### ==================== Important Status ====================

### Get all important statuses
GET http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/important-status/all
Accept: application/json

### Get important status by ID
GET http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/important-status/1
Accept: application/json

### Create important status
POST http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/important-status/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "importantName": "عالي"
}

### Update important status
PUT http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/important-status/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "importantName": "متوسط"
}

### Delete important status
DELETE http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/important-status/1


### ==================== Risk Status ====================

### Get all risk statuses
GET http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/risk-status/all
Accept: application/json

### Get risk status by ID
GET http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/risk-status/1
Accept: application/json

### Create risk status
POST http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/risk-status/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "riskName": "خطر عالي"
}

### Update risk status
PUT http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/risk-status/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "riskName": "خطر متوسط"
}

### Delete risk status
DELETE http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/risk-status/1
